Translation layer over pure parsing: Translate(parse.Request error). Parse errors are *ValidationError (400) or
opaque / strconv-wrapped (500); none contains ErrDuplicate, has a custom Is method or is unresolved.
Expect only fresh *api.Error values and api.ErrUnavailable (the 409 site has no cause to show; the 404/402/503
sites are a tolerated path-insensitive over-approximation) and NOTHING behind (*api.Error).Unwrap: no parse,
strconv, json or domain origin.
